## 0. Paper identification — CONFIRMED

**[LIT]** arXiv:**2212.08694** — *"The Hitchhiker's guide to the galaxy catalog approach
for gravitational wave cosmology"*, Gair, Ghosh, Gray, Holz, Mastrogiovanni, Mukherjee,
Palmese, Tamanini, Baker, Beirnaert, Bilicki, Chen, Dálya, Ezquiaga, Farr, Fishbach,
Garcia-Bellido, T. Ghosh, Huang, Karathanasis, Leyde, Magaña Hernandez, Noller, Pierra,
Raffai, Romano, Seglar-Arroyo, Steer, Turski, Vaccaro, Vallejo-Peña (AJ 2023).

The author's guess was correct. Full text obtained from `ar5iv.labs.arxiv.org/html/2212.08694`;
all quotes below are verbatim from that rendering (section/equation numbers as printed there).

**Prior use in this repo:** this paper is *already cited* in
`docs/BIAS_RESOLUTION_ATTEMPTS_REPORT.md:175-179` and at `:234` and `:266`. That citation
already states the substance of S1. See §4 (prior art) — this is NOT a first encounter.

